wer than department visibility.\",\"capability_gap\":\"Department-scoped reads and owner-only transition authority require an in-command principal/owner check.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"lead\"],\"read_set\":[\"lead\"],\"write_set\":[\"lead\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"owner check, conditional state/timestamp write, and audit are one unit\"},{\"key\":\"mark_qualified\",\"trigger\":\"business_command\",\"scope\":\"multi_record\",\"atomicity\":\"multi_record\",\"failure_semantics\":\"rollback_command\",\"owner\":\"business_handler\",\"resource_key\":\"lead.mark_qualified\",\"rationale\":\"Owner-only transition is narrower than department visibility.\",\"capability_gap\":\"Department-scoped reads and owner-only transition authority require an in-command principal/owner check.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"lead\"],\"read_set\":[\"lead\"],\"write_set\":[\"lead\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"owner check, conditional state/timestamp write, and audit are one unit\"},{\"key\":\"mark_lost\",\"trigger\":\"business_command\",\"scope\":\"multi_record\",\"atomicity\":\"multi_record\",\"failure_semantics\":\"rollback_command\",\"owner\":\"business_handler\",\"resource_key\":\"lead.mark_lost\",\"rationale\":\"Owner-only terminal transition is narrower than department visibility.\",\"capability_gap\":\"Department-scoped reads and owner-only transition authority require an in-command principal/owner check.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"lead\"],\"read_set\":[\"lead\"],\"write_set\":[\"lead\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"owner check, conditional terminal state/timestamp write, and audit are one unit\"}]}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json-8-    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r05_create_idempotency\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R05: Retrying lead creation with the same idempotency key creates exactly one lead.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Same key and payload replay one identity; changed payload reaches the published conflict category.\"],\"behaviors\":[],\"no_executable_behavior_reason\":\"Runtime create operation and its caller-key idempotency contract are owned by R03.\"}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json:9:    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r06_conversion_branch\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R06: An owner initiates conversion from qualified; amounts below 100000 convert directly and amounts at least 100000 create one pending approval while the lead stays qualified.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"99999.99 creates one customer and converts atomically.\",\"100000.00 creates one independent pending approval with threshold/input snapshot and no customer.\"],\"behaviors\":[{\"key\":\"initiate_conversion\",\"trigger\":\"business_command\",\"scope\":\"multi_record\",\"atomicity\":\"multi_record\",\"failure_semantics\":\"rollback_command\",\"owner\":\"business_handler\",\"resource_key\":\"lead.initiate_conversion\",\"rationale\":\"The threshold branch atomically updates lead or creates approval/customer across records.\",\"capability_gap\":\"No generic record operation can branch on an exact amount and atomically create the correct related record while enforcing one-customer/one-active-approval invariants.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"lead\",\"conversion_approval\",\"customer\"],\"read_set\":[\"lead\",\"conversion_approval\",\"customer\"],\"write_set\":[\"lead\",\"conversion_approval\",\"customer\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"branch selection, uniqueness checks, lead transition, approval/customer creation, and audit commit or roll back together\"}]}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json:10:    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r07_approval_decision\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R07: Director approval converts the lead and creates one customer atomically; rejection retains qualified and records the reason.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Approved branch atomically closes approval, converts lead, and creates one customer.\",\"Rejected branch closes approval, retains qualified, records reason, and creates no customer.\"],\"behaviors\":[{\"key\":\"approve_conversion\",\"trigger\":\"business_command\",\"scope\":\"multi_record\",\"atomicity\":\"multi_record\",\"failure_semantics\":\"rollback_command\",\"owner\":\"business_handler\",\"resource_key\":\"conversion_approval.approve_conversion\",\"rationale\":\"Approval terminal effect spans approval, lead, customer, audit, and after-commit Inbox intent.\",\"capability_gap\":\"Workflow task completion alone cannot atomically persist the multi-record approved business effect.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"conversion_approval\",\"lead\",\"customer\"],\"read_set\":[\"conversion_approval\",\"lead\",\"customer\"],\"write_set\":[\"conversion_approval\",\"lead\",\"customer\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"approval decision, lead conversion, unique customer, audit, and notification intent are one Runtime unit of work\"},{\"key\":\"reject_conversion\",\"trigger\":\"business_command\",\"scope\":\"multi_record\",\"atomicity\":\"multi_record\",\"failure_semantics\":\"rollback_command\",\"owner\":\"business_handler\",\"resource_key\":\"conversion_approval.reject_conversion\",\"rationale\":\"Rejection terminal effect spans approval, lead guard, audit, and after-commit Inbox intent.\",\"capability_gap\":\"Workflow task completion alone cannot atomically persist the rejection reason and guarded lead outcome.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"conversion_approval\",\"lead\"],\"read_set\":[\"conversion_approval\",\"lead\"],\"write_set\":[\"conversion_approval\",\"lead\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"approval rejection, reason, qualified lead preservation, audit, and notification intent are one Runtime unit of work\"},{\"key\":\"conversion_approval_process\",\"trigger\":\"workflow_progression\",\"scope\":\"process\",\"atomicity\":\"long_running\",\"failure_semantics\":\"resume_process\",\"owner\":\"workflow\",\"resource_key\":\"conversion_approval_process\",\"rationale\":\"The large-conversion path waits for a human director decision and resumes the correct terminal Action branch.\"}]}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json-11-    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r08_conversion_idempotency\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R08: Repeated or concurrent conversion initiation/decision never creates a second customer.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Replay and concurrency preserve one pending approval, one decision, and one source-lead customer.\"],\"behaviors\":[],\"no_executable_behavior_reason\":\"Idempotency, conditional writes, and uniqueness are contracts on the R06/R07 Actions and objects.\"}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json-12-    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r09_approval_notifications\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R09: Approved and rejected results produce one durable requester-only Business Inbox notification after commit.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Initiating rep sees one linked terminal item; another user does not; replay creates no duplicate.\"],\"behaviors\":[],\"no_executable_behavior_reason\":\"The R07 terminal Actions own typed notification intent dispatch inside their transaction.\"}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json-13-    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r10_customer_immutable\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R10: Customer records created by conversion are immutable to business roles and have no inferred business read surface.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"Customer linkage persists; direct create/update/delete and business menus are absent or denied.\"],\"behaviors\":[],\"no_executable_behavior_reason\":\"This is declarative least-privilege exposure and immutable command-bound persistence; no customer CRUD behavior is granted.\"}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json-14-    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r11_sales_s