t-seven-day/ineligible records do not; retry/restart deduplicates.\"],\"behaviors\":[{\"key\":\"dispatch_stale_reminders\",\"trigger\":\"business_command\",\"scope\":\"multi_record\",\"atomicity\":\"multi_record\",\"failure_semantics\":\"rollback_command\",\"owner\":\"business_handler\",\"resource_key\":\"lead.dispatch_stale_reminders\",\"rationale\":\"A bounded scan, current-state recheck, receipt compare-and-create, and per-owner notification intent require project orchestration.\",\"capability_gap\":\"Scheduler and Workflow dispatch do not implement the CRM-specific eligibility predicate and lead/business-date deduplication.\",\"involved_objects\":[\"lead\",\"lead_reminder_receipt\"],\"read_set\":[\"lead\",\"lead_reminder_receipt\"],\"write_set\":[\"lead_reminder_receipt\"],\"transaction_requirement\":\"each bounded candidate batch rechecks eligibility and atomically creates receipt plus notification intent\"},{\"key\":\"stale_reminder_workflow\",\"trigger\":\"workflow_progression\",\"scope\":\"process\",\"atomicity\":\"long_running\",\"failure_semantics\":\"resume_process\",\"owner\":\"workflow\",\"resource_key\":\"stale_contact_reminder_workflow\",\"rationale\":\"Scheduler targets a durable scheduled Workflow which invokes the bounded project Action.\"},{\"key\":\"weekday_stale_reminder_schedule\",\"trigger\":\"schedule\",\"scope\":\"process\",\"atomicity\":\"long_running\",\"failure_semantics\":\"retry_schedule\",\"owner\":\"scheduler\",\"resource_key\":\"weekday_stale_contact_reminders\",\"rationale\":\"Runtime Scheduler owns weekday wall-clock dispatch, retries, missed windows, and recovery.\"}]}}},\nbackend/model/10-requirements.json-18-    {\"module\":\"requirements\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"key\":\"r15_funnel_report\",\"payload\":{\"requirement\":{\"statement\":\"R15: Directors alone query a funnel report with every lead state bucket, exact row count, present-amount sum, and missing-amount count.\",\"acceptance_criteria\":[\"All five state rows reconci